name: The Club — club debuff
author: corpus
description: >-
  The Club debuffs all Club cards. Ante 1 boss: avoid Club-dependent builds; use other
  suits or Smeared Joker to bypass.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - boss: TheClub
    antes: [1]
should:
  - joker: SmearedJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Luchador
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: Chicot
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
